  "prefLabel": "Pda 502.06 Commercial use mooring",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 502.06 “Commercial use mooring” means a mooring permitted by the division pursuant to Pda 500 and owned by a commercial entity for use only by the commercial entity.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (formerly Pda 502.08) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
